spans.s:
. du. आ॑पिबतम्, RV. ii, 36, 6; pf. -पपौ:
Pass. -पीयते, &c.) to drink in, suck in or up;
to sip, RV.; MBh.; Ragh.;
to drink in with ears or eyes i.e. to hear or See with attention, hang on BhP.; Ragh.;
to absorb, take away:
Caus. -पाययति, to cause to drink or suck in BhP.

अप-√ 1. कॄ Ā. अप-स्-किरते (Pāṇ. vi, 1, 142) to scrape with the feet, Uttarar.;
 (cf. अव-√ स्-कॄ) :
P. अप-किरति, to spout out, spurt, scatter, Pāṇ. i, 3, 21 Comm.;
to throw down, L.

अपा-√ 1. कृ to remove, drive away, (Ved. Inf. अपा॑कर्तोः), MaitrS.;
to cast off, reject, desist from, MBh. &c.;
to select for a present, PBr.; KātyŚr.;
to reject (an opinion).

अप-√ कृष् cl. 1. P. -कर्षति, to draw off or aside, drag down, carry away, take away, remove;
to omit, diminish;
to put away;
to anticipate a word &c. which occurs later (in a sentence);
to bend (a bow);
to detract, debase, dishonour:
Caus. -कर्षयति, to remove, diminish, detract.

अप-√ क्रम् to go away, retreat, retire from, RV. x, 164, 1 &c.;
to glide away;
to measure off by steps, Kauś. :
Caus. -क्रमयति, to cause to run away, PBr. :
Desid. -चिक्रमिषति, to intend to run away or escape (with abl.), ŚBr.

अप-√ गुर् to reject, disapprove, threaten, RV. v, 32, 6, &c.;
to inveigh against any one:
Intens. part. अप-ज॑र्गुराण (see s.v. अप- √ 2. गॄ).

2. अप-√ 1. चि -चिनोति, to gather, collect:
Pass. -चीयते, to be injured in health or prosperity;
to grow less;
to wane;
 (with abl.) to lose anything, MBh.

1. आ-√ पद् Ā. -पद्यते (pf. -पेदे aor. आपादि, &c.) to come, walk near, approach, BhP.;
to enter, get in, arrive at, go into, ŚBr.; Lāṭy.; R. &c.;
to fall in or into;
to be changed into, be reduced to any state;
to get into trouble, fall into misfortune, AV. viii, 8, 18;
 xi, 1, 30; ŚBr.; AitBr.; MBh.; Mn. &c.;
to get, attain, take possession;
to happen, occur, ŚBr.; Mālav. &c.:
Caus. -पादयति (aor. 1. pl. आ॑-पीपदाम, AV. x, 5, 42) to cause to enter, bring on ŚBr.;
to bring to any state, Ragh.;
to bring into trouble or misfortune, R. &c.;
to bring near or towards, fetch, procure, produce, cause, effect, MBh.; Suśr.; Ragh. &c.;
to procure for one's self, obtain, take possession, BhP.;
to change, transform.

अप-√ नी to lead away or off;
to rob, steal, take or drag away;
to remove, frighten away;
to put off or away (as garments, ornaments, or fetters);
to extract, take from;
to deny Comm. on Mn. viii, 53, 59;
to except, exclude from a rule Comm. on RPrāt. :
Desid. -निनीषति, to wish to remove Comm. on Mn. i, 27.

. pl. -भजाम) to cede or transfer a share to, RV. x, 108, 9; ŚBr.;
to satisfy the claim of (acc.), KātyŚr.;
to divide into parts, PBr.; ŚāṅkhŚr.

(or अप-भ्रंस), अस्, m. falling down, a fall, TS. &c.;
 a corrupted form of a word, corruption;
 ungrammatical language
 the most corrupt of the Prākṛt dialects.

(or अप-भ्रंस), अस्, m. falling down, a fall, TS. &c.;
 a corrupted form of a word, corruption;
 ungrammatical language
 the most corrupt of the Prākṛt dialects.

अप-√ या to go away, depart, retire from (abl.).;
to fall off:
Caus. -यापयति, to carry away by violence, BhP.

अप-√ राध् -राध्यति or -राध्नोति, to miss (one's aim, &c.), AV. &c.;
to wrong, offend against (gen. or loc.);
to offend, sin.

अप-√ वद् P. to revile, abuse, TBr. &c.;
to distract, divert, console by tales, PārGṛ.; Yājñ.;
 (in Gr.) to except, RPrāt.;
 (Ā. only) to disown, deny, contradict, Pāṇ. i, 3, 77, Sch.:
Caus. -वादयति, to oppose as unadvisable;
to revile;
 (in Gr.) to except, RPrāt.

अप-√ वह् to carry off;
to deduct;
to give up:
Caus. -वाहयति, to have (something) carried off or taken away;
to drive away, Daś.; Pañcat.

. sg. [in RV.] once अ॑प वृधि and five times अ॑पा वृधि [cf. अपा- √ 1. वृ and ib. अ॑पा-वृत]; perf. 2. sg. -वव॑र्थ, 3. sg. -ववार)
to open, uncover, exhibit, RV.;
 (ind.p. -वृत्य), ŚBr. xiv;
 (cf. अपा- √ 1. वृ) :
Caus. -वारयति, ‘to hide, conceal’, see अप-वारित.

. sg. अ॑पावृक्)
to turn off, drive off, AV.; ŚBr.;
to tear off, AV.;
 (with अ॑ध्वानम्) carpere viam [BR.], RV. x, 117, 7;
to leave off, determine, fulfil, ŚBr. &c.:
Caus. -वर्जयति, to quit, get rid of;
to sever, turn off from to transmit, bestow, grant, MBh. &c.

अप-√ वृत् to turn away, depart;
to move out from, get out of the way, slip off:
Caus. P. (Ved.

. sg. -वर्तया) to turn or drive away from, RV. ii, 23, 7 &c.;
 (in arithm.) to divide;
to reduce to a common measure.

. du. -विध्यताम्) to drive away, throw away, RV. vii, 75, 4, &c.;
to pierce (with arrows), MBh.;
to reject, neglect.

2. अपास् (√ 2. अस्), to fling away, throw away or off, discard, to scare, drive away;
to leave behind;
to take no notice of, disregard.

अप-√ सृ (impf. -सरत्) to slip off from (abl.), RV. iv, 30, 10;
to go away, retreat:
Caus. -सारयति, to make or let go away, remove.

अप-√ हृ to snatch away, carry off, plunder;
to remove, throw away:
Caus. -हारयति See अप-हारित below.

अप-√ ह्नु Ā. (1. sg. -ह्नुवे॑) to refuse, RV. i, 138, 4;
to conceal, disguise, deny, Kāṭh. &c.;
to excuse one's self, give satisfaction to, ŚBr.; TBr.

आ-√ 1. पत् P. -पतति, (p. acc. -पतन्तम्, AV. xii, 4, 47; aor. आ॑-पप्तत, RV. i, 88, 1 [Pāṇ. vii, 4, 19]; Pot. perf. आ॑-पपत्यात्, AV. vi, 29, 3)
to fly towards, come flying;
to hasten towards, rush in or on RV.; AV.; ŚBr.; Hariv.; Ragh. &c.;
to fall towards or on Kathās.;
to approach;
to assail;
to fall out, happen;
to appear, appear suddenly;
to fall to one's share, to befall, MBh.; R.; Rājat.; BhP.; Pañcat.; Kād. &c.:
Caus. P. (3. pl. -पत॑यन्ति, RV. x, 64, 2) to fly towards;
 -पातयति, to throw down, let fall, cut down;
to shed, BhP.; Hariv.; Mn.
